---
import Legal from '../components/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Legal title="Terms of Use" description="Terms for using the Solutions for Women website." updated="September 2026">
  <p>
    Welcome to the Solutions for Women website. By using this site you agree to these terms. If you do not agree,
    please do not use the site.
  </p>

  <h2>About the content</h2>
  <p>
    This site shares information about Solutions for Women, our support groups, events and ways to get involved. It is
    provided for general information only and is not medical, legal or mental health advice. If you are in crisis,
    call or text 988, or call 911 in an emergency.
  </p>

  <h2>Photos and materials</h2>
  <p>
    Photos, text and graphics on this site belong to Solutions for Women or are used with permission. Please do not
    reuse them without asking us first. If you appear in a photo and would like it removed, email{' '}
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we will take it down.
  </p>

  <h2>Donations</h2>
  <p>
    Online donations are processed by PayPal and are subject to PayPal's terms. Solutions for Women is a registered
    501(c)(3) charity, EIN {site.ein}. Donations are tax-deductible to the extent allowed by law.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>
    We link to partners and other organizations we think are helpful. We are not responsible for the content or
    practices of those sites.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows when they last changed.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
</Legal>
